      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEBLEC JOEL (7) won by 4.5 lengths last start when getting around Sandown 515m in a dynamic 29.37. In form and looks the one to beat again. MEPUNGA SPIRIT (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (30.26) in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Has ability and is one of the better chances. FULL BORE DONNY (3) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 0.8 lengths away in second (29.87) at Sandown in a Grade 5 over 515m. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Expected to be in the finish again. PAW IRULAN (2) is likely to have admirers.",
